{"availability":"available","full":"ShoeSafari-Org/ShoeSafari","name":"ShoeSafari","description":"E-commerce platform showcasing Stellar/Soroban blockchain payments - USDC checkout, escrow contracts, and Freighter wallet integration","category":"Business","language":"TypeScript","stars":84,"forks":109,"created":"2024-07-15T12:42:21Z","updated":"2026-10-16T07:06:37Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://shoe-safari.vercel.app","topics":["blockchain","crypto-payments","ecommerce","nextjs","soroban","stellar","web3"],"demo":"https://shoe-safari.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T07:14:57.843Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T07:14:57.843Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T07:14:57.843Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T04:52:16.211Z","stars":84,"forks":89},{"at":"2026-10-10T13:01:30.651Z","stars":84,"forks":89},{"at":"2026-10-16T07:14:57.843Z","stars":84,"forks":109}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real, operating footwear store — not a demo — with Stellar USDC checkout","ShoeSafari is a live online footwear store that sells products and accepts USDC payments on the Stellar network. The store has processed more than $10,000 USDC in product sales on Stellar. Customers can browse footwear, place orders, and pay from their own Freighter wallet.","This is not a demo or mock storefront. ShoeSafari sells real products to customers and processes real USDC product payments on Stellar."],"features":["Next.js 14 App Router + Tailwind CSS storefront (catalog, cart, checkout,","Soroban checkout with escrow — a Rust smart contract moves USDC (or","native XLM) from the buyer's wallet into an on-chain escrow, records the order, and releases it to the merchant on dispatch or refunds it on-chain.","Freighter wallet integration with network guard, pre-flight simulation,","readiness checks, real-time getEvents indexing, and an explorer link on success."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.co